Error [E0925]: `#Job`/`#Every(…)` only mark a top-level function
  --> tests/ui/schedule_task_on_method.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     #Job
    |     ^^^^
 Why: a task needs a free-standing name for `jet run --task <name> <entry>` — a method has no such name, so it can't be one (D-JPK-TASKRUN1).
 Fix: move this function to the top level, beside `fn run()`.
